{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>כי</b> — Then the young men and maidens will rejoice, to play music and to drink wine after their meal. This is the meaning of כי: how goodly is…, on that day mentioned above." "<b>דגן בחורים ותירוש ינובב בתולות</b> — From the derivation: ינובון בשיבה. But the correct view: from the derivation of ניב שפתים, and the verb is intransitive, like שובב יקומם."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:34.806239798Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}